# Runtime input: integration steps. Four bodies use deterministic doubles.
ARGS=コマンドライン
N=ARGS[要素数(ARGS)-1]
N=INT(N)
X=[0.0,1.0,-1.0,0.0]
Y=[0.0,0.0,0.0,1.0]
VX=[0.0,0.0,0.0,-0.2]
VY=[0.3,-0.3,0.2,0.0]
N回
I=0
4回
J=0
4回
もしI!=Jならば
DX=X[J]-X[I]
DY=Y[J]-Y[I]
D=DX*DX+DY*DY+0.01
INV=1/SQRT(D)
VX[I]=VX[I]+DX*INV*0.0005
VY[I]=VY[I]+DY*INV*0.0005
ここまで
J=J+1
ここまで
I=I+1
ここまで
I=0
4回
X[I]=X[I]+VX[I]
Y[I]=Y[I]+VY[I]
I=I+1
ここまで
ここまで
K=INT(ABS(X[0])*1000000)+INT(ABS(Y[1])*1000000)
Kを表示
